# slot <TAB> conversation-uuid
#
# Written automatically by `ccs` on the first launch of each slot, and read by
# `ccs-state` to map a Claude session_id back to its slot name.
#
# You only need to edit this by hand to ADOPT a conversation that already
# exists under a different uuid. Slots absent from the file derive a stable
# uuid from the slot name.
main	00000000-1111-4222-a333-444444444444
